Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?tools(gguf):=20retagger=20v2=20=E2=80=94=20stru?=
 =?UTF-8?q?cture-only=20parser,=20no=20tensor=20materialization?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

v1 failed its first live test: it opened g128 GGUFs via gguf-py, which only
knows canonical Q2_0 as g64 and could not reshape the 128-block tensor data
(cannot reshape array ... into shape). v2 is a hand-written GGUF v3 structure
reader (header/KV/tensor-table only, no tensor-data parsing) with arithmetic
alignment recompute on KV-append.

Origin: ArifiLabs lane-110
Measured-effect: tooling only (no runtime engine change); unblocks g128 gate-ON key injection
